      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Here's a situation that happened earlier tonight.\nI have two friends, let's call them \"A\" and \"B\".\nA guy called \"Z\" came into the world and was teleporting around and doing sketchy things with a client.\n\"A\" tried to kick them, but the vote kick got routed to \"B\", and that worried me, since \"A\" and \"B\" are friends and \"A\" would never kick them.\nI couldn't do any moderation since the \"Z\" user had me blocked.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
