      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You are the world created it really should be the case that you can see anyone who joins no matter if they blocked you or not it’s just that simple and I am sorry you had to deal with that man hopefully this will get enough attention that something gets done about it",
      "viewerReactions": null,
